model pc
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, M2 G6's last part (BUILD-LOG's fourth turn; tmp/m2/review-g6b.md): a calendar restated by a version known in a window that holds the cut (G6's cw1; eval/business.rs calendar_row)"

source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input cal: calendar
input d1: date

ask qc: add_business(d1, 1, cal) as known 2026-03-01 windows each
ask qp: add_business(d1, 1, cal) as known 2026-03-01
ask qn: add_business(d1, 1, cal) windows each

version v
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d1 = 2026-06-29 "c"

version c1
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  cal = calendar(weekends [sat, sun], added [window(2026-06-30, 2026-07-01)]) "c"

version c3
  cite card
  governs always
  known window(2026-02-20, 2026-03-10)
  replace cal = calendar(weekends [sat, sun], added [window(2026-06-30, 2026-07-02)]) "c3"
